WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.570
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.650
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:16.570
We're fast approaching the start of the Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:22.460
Only the top four ranked idols will have the right to participate.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.880
Everyone's currently hopping from event to event, trying to gain as many points as they can.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.210
And at one of them, Elza-san finally obtained the Sun Dress that she longed for.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:34.590
She holds a huge lead as we close in on the Final Tournament.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.930
<i>The Sun Dress.</i>

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:44.190
<i>I'll win the Final Tournament and become truly perfect...</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:49.820
<i>Just one more step until I reach Mother.</i>

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:55.820
Elza-san presently holds the number one spot of the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.950
She's got a ticket to the Tournament in the bag.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.950
And Yume-chan in second is sure to make it in too!

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:03.450
You really think so?

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.330
Everyone else still has a chance to take third or fourth. {except Rola...}

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:08.630
Even us!

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.670
We can't give up yet!

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.420
You said it.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.760
Yeah, I'm in too!

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:22.310
It says Elza-san is holding an emergency press conference!

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.980
I have called you here to make an important announcement.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.230
This coming March...

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:36.110
Venus Ark will close down.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:16.710
This press conference is over.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.590
Venus Ark is shutting down?

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.680
What's going to happen?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.220
Elza, what's the meaning of this?

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:32.100
I gathered all these idols for the sole purpose of obtaining the Sun Dress.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:36.570
Now that I have it, I no longer have need of them.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.240
Even us?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.990
Of course.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.120
Elza!

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:52.500
It must be some sort of joke, closing down Venus Ark.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:58.500
Elza-sama would never say that she doesn't need us anymore on a whim.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:03.090
It's Elza-sama we're talking about. Once she puts her mind to something, she follows through.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.510
Well, then...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:11.560
I'll follow through too! With my love for Elza-sama!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:18.520
I want to know the real reason Elza-sama said she wants to close Venus Ark.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:22.450
And the best way I can think of doing that is winning the Aikatsu Ranking!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:26.030
Then she's sure to look straight at Kirara again!

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.910
I'll make her turn my way again!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.410
Right, as will I!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.250
I understand your uncertainty completely.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:43.260
There may even be some of you considering 
transferring out or returning to your homeland.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:51.180
But please, would you consider waiting at least until I pry the meaning out of Elza's words?

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:55.650
I'm certain she did not make her decision lightly.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:05:00.570
Believe that she still treasures each of you as much as she has.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:05.530
That's all I ask of you.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.990
What do you think of this event?

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.700
Which one?

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.370
Whoa, it gives tons of points!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.830
I wonder what it's about.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.880
"Triathlon Idol Fest"? {I hated it before, and I still hate the spelling of triathlon}{what's wrong with it?}{should be triathalon}

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.090
Yes.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.130
It begins with dancing, acting, and a fashion show.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:27.800
Then there's a quiz, flower arranging, and other types of competitions.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:31.680
Only the one idol who makes it through them all is allowed a performance.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:37.100
That's harsh... That's a very triathlon event.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:40.820
And that's exactly why it gives so many points.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.230
Let's register right away.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.490
What's wrong, Kirara?

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.030
Well...

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.790
Eat up...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.290
I...I'll have some.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:10.300
Passing out is baa!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.930
With cooking this bad...

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:15.980
Are you giving up then?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.230
Giving up is even more baa!

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:21.730
Then there's only one thing to do.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.570
Train.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.650
Delicious!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:31.490
Three stars!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:35.700
The task is to make the dish you're best at.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:39.830
In other words, you only need to focus on perfecting a single recipe.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.380
Please teach me, Rei-sensei!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.000
Me too!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.090
You have trouble cooking too, Aria?

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.260
Yes! But I love doing it!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.850
What dish should we use?

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:58.810
Something simple and safe would be an omelette or curry.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:03.310
Bountiful spring veggies, meat, and fish paella!{should we translate this more ridiculous?}

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.190
Doesn't it sound yummy?

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:08.110
Maybe we should start with the proper way to hold a knife.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.070
Yes!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:17.580
I suppose we should call the training a success considering it's at least edible.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.460
I'm ready too!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.050
It's good!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.010
Yay!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:38.680
It looks just as bad as mine, but the flavors bounce around my tongue.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:43.230
It could be that your lack of confidence is holding you back.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:52.360
That's it, she's using her love as a spice.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:58.620
Okay! Time to cook it full of Kirara's love!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.620
That really came out of nowhere.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.500
I can't believe Venus Ark is closing.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:10.260
Do you think it has anything to do with Elza-san getting the Sun Dress?

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.930
If it does, that kind of worries me.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.680
Let's take a break.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.020
Here, eat up.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.150
Hāngī food!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.900
It's a traditional meal from your homeland, New Zealand.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:35.950
It's normally wrapped in flax leaves and buried, but since we're on a boat I had to approximate.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:43.210
My mouth is filled with beautiful nature!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.580
Kirara, you don't like it?

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:54.470
It brought back memories. I was eating Hāngī food back then too.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:09:03.060
You see, even back in New Zealand, I loved being able to let my emotions run wild.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:08.860
I dressed up however I wanted, and sang and danced to my own rhythm.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.400
But then...

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.200
Let the sheep shearing contest start!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.200
Speed is the most important part of shearing!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.950
No, it's make sure you don't stress out the sheep!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:24.460
You gotta give them a pretty haircut!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.630
Being pretty has nothing to do with shearing.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.710
You really are weird, Kirara.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.680
They said I'm weird.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.760
I happen to love it.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.310
That weirdness of yours.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:50.310
It is the Kirara-colored gleam that only your Hanazono Kirara gemstone can produce.{aikatsu has so much word soup}{we could make it less word soupy, but this one is aikatsu enough to keep}

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:54.320
I will perfect your radiance.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:58.070
Come to Venus Ark!

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.330
Elza-sama was stunningly brilliant.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.910
She was the first person to really see me.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:13.340
She gave me the confidence to shine in my own way!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.670
What do you mean, Rola?

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.430
Why are you worried about Elza-san?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.300
I felt it when we competed on stage.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:27.430
The radiance she gave off when she donned the Sun Dress...

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.980
It was very sharp, just like a knife.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:38.700
It almost felt like no one was ever allowed near her.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.280
Where is she trying to go?

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.200
All by herself...

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.250
Elza-sama.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:57.010
Are you perhaps thinking that it would pain you far too much to selfishly drag the others along any further? {there's really no good break point}{at least we can short it, even if split the preposit}

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.690
How's this one?

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.450
Yeah, this one's good.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.450
Really?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.700
I can feel the fun spreading in my mouth!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:30.960
All right! I'm definitely gonna win!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:40.720
Starting with dancing, a fashion show, and acting,

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.970
{=9}Triathlon Idol Fest

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.970
{=8}Triathlon Idol Fest

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:45.300
followed by flower arranging, a quiz, cooking, and more,

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:49.850
only the one idol who manages to make it to the end can put on a performance.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.980
The Triathlon Idol Fest is about to begin!

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.650
The first round is dancing.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:05.490
Kizaki Rei and Hanazono Kirara 
blow clean past the competition!

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.200
Next up is the fashion show.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.000
Just look at their stylish walks!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.250
And on the score board...

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.750
Are the same two clear victors!

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:34.400
After the 500 question fastest finger quiz,
 only four participants remain.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.310
The biggest hurdle comes next.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.610
Kirara's greatest weakness is her cooking.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:45.860
Each idol will create one dish for the judges to score.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.200
Only two can pass this round!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.160
<i>I trained my heart out.</i>

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:58.380
<i>I can make this bountiful spring veggies, meat, and fish paella even with my eyes closed.</i>

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.550
Huh?!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.760
Those are the wrong ingredients!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.890
Could it be?

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:11.350
They prepared the ingredients for the parfait on the next page?

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.230
What should I do? Making paella is impossible...

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:22.070
But I won't get any points unless I clear this stage and perform.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.950
If I can't, then the Final Tournament...

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:31.290
No! Kirara can "Kiraran" her way through this!{I find it very strange that there are no signs of struggle here}

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.420
It's the treasure I received from Elza-sama!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:37.960
Kirara.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.460
Rei-chan pounded the basics of cooking into me!

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.590
What superb handling.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:48.090
And Aria-chan gave me a love of cooking!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.180
She's having fun with it.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.100
That's how cooking should be.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.850
The finishing touch!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.850
That's time!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.200
Kizaki Rei-san's cooking was particularly impressive.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:15.120
Beyond the dynamic umami lies a delicate and complex flavor.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.330
Even a pro wouldn't compare.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.120
Thank you.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:23.590
The last contestant is Hanazono Kirara.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:34.010
This! It's more than just sweet! {tasting one part of a parfait and judging the whole thing is the worst meme}{lots of video games work this way}

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.680
There's absolutely nothing else like this! {I know it's a bit off}

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:42.060
This Kirara-san flavor could be created by none other than Hanazono Kirara!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:49.360
It is the Kirara-colored gleam that only your Hanazono Kirara gemstone can produce.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.160
The results are in! Proceeding to the final round are...

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:00.670
Kizaki Rei and Hanazono Kirara!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.170
Yay!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:09.050
The rigorous barrage of tasks is finally coming to a head.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:13.430
The final challenge is a marathon to the stage.{the one time we can actually use stage}

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:19.180
Who will grab the mic behind the finish line and earn her place on stage?

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.310
On your marks.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:33.320
Running a marathon after all those other rounds isn't going to be easy.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:35.990
Kirara-san, Rei-san...

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.210
Drop out if you can't go on, Kirara.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.000
No way!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:50.220
I'm gonna make Elza-sama turn my way again!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.720
It's my duty to get Elza back!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:00.060
Kirara's love for Elza-sama is much stronger!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.360
Kirara!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.200
You're okay...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.370
Are you hurt, Kirara?

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.250
Don't force yourself.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.330
I will!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:27.380
Because... I have to make Elza-sama...

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.720
Rei-chan.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.360
It's the finish line.{on the one hand, I really like Air, but on the other, this is the responsible translation}{well I guess if /you/ say this, I can't refuse}

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.650
You did well, Kirara.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.040
The victor is Hanazono Kirara!

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:11.590
Rei-chan!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.130
Make sure your feelings reach Elza.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.140
I will!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:30.150
Come have a fluffy sweet dream with Kirara!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.590
I'll knock 'em out with my battle dress!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.140
Under normal circumstances,

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:56.270
runners in a marathon who touch someone else are disqualified.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:59.480
However, this one was part of an idol event.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:03.860
I have received word that both of you are counted as having finished.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:11.290
In addition, due to Kirara-sama having 
needed support, the race is marked as a tie.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:15.120
Therefore, Rei-sama has been awarded an equivalent amount of points.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.880
What about Elza-sama?

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.050
Is she still holed up in her room?

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:22.300
Sebastian. {9/10 I go for this when I can't avoid it. it's not very nice just to call him "Butler"}{it's a meme, but it's fine}

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:25.680
I will take my meal out in the sea breeze.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.390
Very well.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.300
Elza!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:33.520
Don't misunderstand me. I only came to give a warning.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:36.810
I always follow through on my convictions to the end.{I'm proud you got this}

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.310
We know.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.570
But I won't give up either!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.190
I won't back down no matter what.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:49.530
Isn't that why you invited us all to Venus Ark?

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:51.950
Right, Rei-chan?

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:56.330
Yeah. It was Perfect Elza's one and only mistake.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:01.840
You didn't expect us to be this head over heels for you, right?

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:07.090
You can shine brightly enough on your own even without me.

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:10.350
No, it's still not enough.

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:15.600
We'll become so bright you won't be able to look away again.

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:18.690
You'd best prepare yourself.

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:59.080
I've gotta Aikatsu so hard it brings Elza-sama back!

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:02.620
The best Aikatsu I can with my precious Star Wings!

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:05.670
Aikatsu beyond perfection is our only ray of hope!

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:09.300
I will dedicate my everything for Elza!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.880
Aikatsu is suffering.

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:15.600
What?! Aria-chan's acting strange!

00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:18.010
No, the real fight starts now!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:20.180
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.180 --> 00:24:21.770
Hussle Idol Discipline.

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.150
Become the first-star idol!
